@prefix eco:<https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#>. @prefix skos:<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>.
eco:ReversibleGraphCandidate a eco:GovernanceInvariant,skos:Concept;skos:prefLabel "reversible graph candidate";skos:definition "New repositories and packs enter first as reversible graph facts or candidates before irreversible selection.";eco:falsifier "Irreversible admission without a reversible candidate state falsifies this invariant.".
